   feat(foundry): add SQLite run index, auto-explain on failure, and approval gate

   - output.py: add write_run_index, write_next_action, resolve_next_action_for_run with pruning
   - runner.py: call write_run_index after every run, auto-explain on fail with try/except guard, resolve on pass, approval_required gate before agent fire
   - explain.py: add extract_next_action using claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
   - config.py: add approval_required to integrations.agent (default False)"
    ]

    done [
        label="Done"
